#### matches RFC 4231 HMAC-SHA-256 TC1

- Verify: matches RFC 4231 HMAC-SHA-256 TC1
   - Expected: _bytes_to_hex(mac) equals `b0344c61d8db38535ca8afceaf0bf12b881dc200c9833da726e9376c2e32cff7`


